            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.111</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Video preview</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Trim clips in the preview.</b> Shorten a video right in the preview and save it as a new clip. You no longer need to open your editing software for a simple cut.</li>
<li><b>New arrow keys.</b> In the preview, up and down now browse through your assets, and left and right step one frame at a time. Left and right used to browse.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
