            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.110</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Pay as you go and Cloud Collab</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Top up instead of a subscription.</b> Choose a credit package or any amount from 10 EUR. The window shows what your credits buy in images, videos and music.</li>
<li><b>Cloud Collab.</b> Share cloud folders with your team with 20 GB, 50 GB or 1 TB of storage. Only the folder owner subscribes, invited people work for free.</li>
<li><b>Storage at a glance.</b> Used cloud storage now shows in the sidebar and in Cloud &amp; Team.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
